    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateReferenceHighLevelObjective@1, DatasetsReferenceHighLevelObjectiveBinding@1, KitReferenceHighLevelObjectiveBinding@1, and PlatformReferenceHighLevelObjective@1. The declared reference idea is: Modify a typed formal-logic API while reusing unaffected proofs, selecting only impacted tests, rejecting stale-tree evidence, and producing a complete proof-carrying execution receipt. SupervisorObjectiveIntent@1 is admitted with idea digest baguqeeracbayojdov4jmqiirx22pavrg6nabazcocru6y3scrdx5e54mw2zq, distinct from the PCPR-041 contract vector. Declared caller principal:pcpr-060-reference-submitter is intent, never authority. PCPR-004 repaired-path source files are present. Live authenticated Supervisor.run / CLI / MCP submission, live DuckDB or Quack materialization, and START stay typed unavailable. ContextPack construction remains PCPR-061. Durable storage remains PCPR-062. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-060-operator-live-objective-materialization. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
